From 4b25138a3372679734e84ac416e27f5c650ef875 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wooseong Kim <innocarpe@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 21:12:54 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat(shell): add x.ai/deepseek/status extension for
 balance and session usage

Expose a fail-soft `x.ai/deepseek/status` extension for the DeepSeek status
row. Balance requests are gated to DeepSeek endpoints, while session usage is
projected from the in-memory ledger without changing xAI session behavior.
